{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063271/block/singleImage/3264516/df/01M75347SP7F6HTWPS27NF0WQ5.png?updatedAt=1794393905\"/><figcaption>台式餐廳「尚青商號」近日被網民發現結業。(Google Maps截圖)</figcaption></figure><p>位於俗稱「喜帖街」利東街的台式餐廳「尚青商號」，近日被 網民發現 結業，又有網民指，該店已經多天未有營業。根據OpenRice網站顯示，該店已經結業。《am730》曾致電該店，惟電話未能接通。 根據網傳圖片，該店已被貼上拍賣行文件，而該店已被協聯估值及拍賣行在10月14日公開拍賣餐廳內之傢俱及設備。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063271/block/singleImage/3264526/df/01M7537X9GSA1BT68VRXRFCW26.png?updatedAt=1794393905\"/><figcaption>該店已被公開拍賣餐廳內之傢俱及設備。(協聯估值及拍賣行)</figcaption></figure><p>翻查資料，「尚青商號」由藝人傅珮嘉及丈夫開設，最初位於在灣仔蘭杜街，其後在2024年搬遷至現址，該店的社交媒體最後一個帖文是在9月23日。</p><p>在 Threads 查看</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T11:37:16.473191+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":298,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T10:44:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T14:32:58.575326+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T11:30:39.733024+00:00","content_hash":"b15443ef3a47db5fba2e4fb6b9625dde7fbd5211fda6e972484b7d93fc2810d4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T11:37:16.473191+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}